Safe Spawn for Horizon 26.3 (version 0.4.0)

A port of Safe Spawn 1.0.0 by Tokimi, CozyStudios.
Original source: https://github.com/CozyCord/SafeSpawn (named in the jar; no longer public as of 2026-11-19)
Original licence: CC0-1.0

Ported to Horizon by lavoide: the rules are re-implemented in Rust on Horizon's mod API (no Java
code is included). This port is distributed under the same licence as the original (CC0-1.0); the licence text is in LICENSE. Built
against Horizon's exact-build SDK dd67b76ff23e28c6d8e21859df600d31572f81a0.

The jar names CC0-1.0 and ships no licence file; LICENSE is the CC0 1.0 text.
